  ┌─ Discard a file ───────────┐
  │ internal/tui/gitform.go    │
  │ goes back to what HEAD     │
  │ holds.                     │
  │                            │
  │ ✕ the changes made to it   │
  │   since are in no commit   │
  │   and no stash             │
  │                            │
  │ runs                       │
  │ git restore --             │
  │ internal/tui/gitform.go    │
  │                            │
  │  y run it  n cancel        │
  └────────────────────────────┘

